ltran Leyva gang and one of the FBI's most wanted fugitives, known as 'Chapo Isidro,' was captured by the Mexican military following a raid and a shootout in the coastal Sinaloa state.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian helicopter suspected of violating Finnish airspace</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6f373695d51b010644daefd08952e13f1b42d8d12cbdb2cf5943f31d0e3e23e5</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:44:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T17:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-helicopter-suspected-of-violating-finnish-airspace/a-80010133--74b233a91706.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-helicopter-suspected-of-violating-finnish-airspace/a-80010133?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Finland's Defense Ministry thinks the incursion is linked to a drone strike earlier Saturday on a Russian cargo ship, which is on a US sanctions list.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU and Indonesia sign trade deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0841e8fda1e5880bc777a10209ebbbd6e7ccd27263caaac24ab60639ab4329f6</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T15:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-and-indonesia-sign-trade-deal/a-80010099--bb068ad239d4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-and-indonesia-sign-trade-deal/a-80010099?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A deal covering 730 million people promises lower tariffs and new investment opportunities as the European Union seeks to diversify trade ties amid growing global economic tensions.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>New EU budget proposal aims at tax gobal tech giants</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4bef1f277c9937f45a7fd1c0649d5f0fe569c8bc32e07717e2e80f8ee9d8d542</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T14:58:00Z</published><link rel="a