">Harassment, persecution, surveillance: Across much of the world, people of faith are facing growing pressure. A new German government report is unusually direct in criticizing China in particular.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>COP31: UN Climate summit runs into overtime as deal remains elusive</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:db368272f761f530843b5ebf30aec9886dbb75893b5375c9d66e7eca1a1d802c</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T10:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cop31-un-climate-summit-runs-into-overtime-as-deal-remains-elusive/live-79999516--3c5a1f09d5b5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cop31-un-climate-summit-runs-into-overtime-as-deal-remains-elusive/live-79999516?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After nearly two weeks of negotiations, countries remain divided on how to fight global warming. A new draft declaration doesn't mention the phaseout of fossil fuels, the main drivers of climate change. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Anthropic researcher uses AI to solve math's greatest riddle</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:747c3c56b543dc41f50b41fdecc6c08217041d841c8ceefcb6ddc56b7ac55f3e</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T10:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/anthropic-researcher-uses-ai-to-solve-math-s-greatest-riddle/a-80008428--770513448c0a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/anthropic-researcher-uses-ai-to-solve-math-s-greatest-riddle/a-80008428?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The proposed breakthrough could reshape mathematical research, but still needs independent verification. It's the latest in a string of cases where AI has outpaced humans in solving famous maths problems.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Support for Ukraine military aid waning, survey shows</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f5878253fc19e881f6c2b7f8fcca58aecddb295d8e1ce970bc8c675dce69fc0b</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T10:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-support-for-ukraine-military-aid-waning-survey-shows/live-80008430--26328b4ef0e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-support-for-ukraine-military-aid-waning-survey-shows/live-80008430?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nearly half of Germany's population wants to reduce military aid to Ukraine, a survey has found. Meanwhile, German consumers are set to pay more in energy bills next year due in part to the Iran war. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Killer robots' talks at UN end with no legally binding ban</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf12ff5b44ac82830a45391fbe9c18357333c4c63f678f61e6557d38058bf4d3</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T09:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/killer-robots-talks-at-un-end-with-no-legally-binding-ban/a-80008584--4680bcbcf3be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/killer-robots-talks-at-un-end-with-no-legally-binding-ban/a-80008584?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Countries have agreed to extend discussions over controls on lethal autonomous weapons systems for two years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US judge jails Indian national in foiled Sikh separatist murder plot</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:15c1c0cc24d80c50ba98bc6a2653e6ab1a63cbd58cf9558a2d69f3d92026275b</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T07:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-judge-jails-indian-national-in-foiled-sikh-separatist-murder-plot/live-80008104--d5e0d47b100e.html" type=