to rescue four missing airmen. The deployment has widened into an operation against Haiti's gangs.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil ex-President Jair Bolsonaro taken to hospital over abdominal pain</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3ae60fdd06fa3ca113367f8edc2e888e0481f75f3a0c0f4523360de9e9f49314</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T03:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-ex-president-jair-bolsonaro-taken-to-hospital-over-abdominal-pain/a-80007648--e735cc923d74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-ex-president-jair-bolsonaro-taken-to-hospital-over-abdominal-pain/a-80007648?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Jair Bolsonaro has been hospitalized in Brasilia with intestinal obstruction. The former far-right Brazilian leader is receiving pain medications, his son Carlos said.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>UK anti-migrant activist jailed for slashing Channel dinghy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ecb4bbfd1bbbdf603974ca7dbbc980662e9f999b209aedc46be8514c5ef7163b</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T02:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-anti-migrant-activist-jailed-for-slashing-channel-dinghy/a-80007576--c3711b9c2af1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-anti-migrant-activist-jailed-for-slashing-channel-dinghy/a-80007576?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Daniel Thomas, known as "Danny Tommo," slashed a dinghy with a knife while a French rescue worker was on board. The incident was livestreamed to a large social media audience amid growing tensions over migrant crossings.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US judge approves Bayer's $7.25 billion cancer settlement</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa148f56de7d3f9cd7ffec44990c710928f1c7061ecd8b6db69b798ef8b5fcc0<