/repression-against-iranian-lawyers-increases/a-80006742?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At least 135 lawyers in Iran have been subjected to repressive measures over the past year. UN experts warn that this seriously jeopardizes the right of those accused to trial in a constitutional court.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>COP31: No agreement on climate science, disinformation spreading</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4136e8f46cb1f111385cd26a1c992affb6a2259f90c0b769f7031deba6bbc78e</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:44:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cop31-no-agreement-on-climate-science-disinformation-spreading/a-80004894--cd9d23743160.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cop31-no-agreement-on-climate-science-disinformation-spreading/a-80004894?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Attacks on climate science and disinformation risk delaying key measures at COP31 in Antalya. As the UN climate talks draw to a close, how will that affect efforts to come to an agreement?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Has the 'Parthenon puzzle' been solved? The long quest to reassemble lost eastern pediment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ca7766f8a8cfe65f19a5d18382be2c8ce103bc4d69709eee55822f5f707a20b2</id><updated>2026-11-21T21:43:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/has-the-parthenon-puzzle-been-solved-the-long-quest-to-reassemble-lost-eastern-pediment/a-79982098--4f23b2ccbfc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/has-the-parthenon-puzzle-been-solved-the-long-quest-to-reassemble-lost-eastern-pediment/a-79982098?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The depiction of the birth of the goddess Athena above the Parthenon's entrance is considered a masterpiece of ancient art. Now, a German research team has pieced together all the surviving fragments.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry></feed>
